WEBVTT

00:02:00.566 --> 00:02:03.066
Th-That's the Galleon?!

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:04.100
It's huge!

00:02:10.233 --> 00:02:11.233
Don't panic!

00:02:11.800 --> 00:02:15.230
Rakrima has no future unless
we hold our defense here!

00:02:22.366 --> 00:02:23.526
Charge!

00:02:44.266 --> 00:02:47.126
Everyone, give it all you've got!
Don't let it enter the town!

00:03:16.833 --> 00:03:19.903
Stop...
Please stop!

00:03:34.466 --> 00:03:39.366
VERSUS THE INDEPENDENT
FLYING SQUADRON

00:03:45.566 --> 00:03:47.166
The target has completely vanished!

00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:49.000
The enemy air forces have
been totally annihilated!

00:03:49.566 --> 00:03:52.526
Shift from first combat positions
to second alert positions!

00:03:52.766 --> 00:03:55.466
All hands, continue patrol operations!

00:03:56.433 --> 00:03:58.903
Everything is proceeding
according to plan.

00:03:59.133 --> 00:04:01.973
But even I never suspected
it would be this easy.

00:04:02.366 --> 00:04:03.026
Indeed...

00:04:03.066 --> 00:04:04.526
Indeed, indeed...

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:10.130
More than half the world has
now come under our rule...

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:13.000
By contrast, that man!

00:04:13.033 --> 00:04:14.203
You mean, Logi?

00:04:14.300 --> 00:04:15.570
Logi! Logi!

00:04:15.733 --> 00:04:17.303
Just as one might expect of
the honorable Lord Nene.

00:04:17.333 --> 00:04:19.503
You are already aware of it.

00:04:19.800 --> 00:04:23.130
How much longer
can we afford to excuse

00:04:23.166 --> 00:04:25.326
the Third Independent Flying
Squadron's incompetence?

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:29.700
They proclaim themselves as
the most powerful Shadow Wielders,

00:04:29.733 --> 00:04:32.233
and yet they can't
even defeat children...

00:04:32.566 --> 00:04:36.066
The troop morale will suffer like this.
Why not send them off to a remote region?

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:37.200
Don't worry about it.

00:04:37.233 --> 00:04:37.903
Huh?

00:04:38.633 --> 00:04:39.933
Leave him be.

00:04:40.566 --> 00:04:42.666
He seems to be trying things
in his own way,

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:44.730
so let's just wait and see
how it goes for a while.

00:04:44.933 --> 00:04:46.203
Y-Yes...

00:04:46.866 --> 00:04:49.826
Are you worried? But it's all right.

00:04:50.333 --> 00:04:53.333
As long as that boy
doesn't get too greedy...

00:05:02.733 --> 00:05:05.373
Thanks to Homeron's
self-sacrificing actions,

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:07.770
we finally know who
has the Extra Seven.

00:05:08.333 --> 00:05:10.803
The one who has it
is General Logi!

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:14.270
We should therefore
take action immediately.

00:05:14.566 --> 00:05:18.526
We're going to make a surprise attack on
Logi's battleship to recover the documents!

00:05:19.633 --> 00:05:22.603
Fortunately, thanks to the information
provided by Homeron's allies,

00:05:22.633 --> 00:05:24.603
we know the position
of the enemy fleet.

00:05:28.066 --> 00:05:30.296
Infiltrate the battleship,

00:05:30.333 --> 00:05:32.603
determine the whereabouts
of the documents, and recover them.

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:38.330
Then get off the battleship immediately.
A large-scale counterattack is expected.

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:43.400
All of you, stay on your guard!
And don't let Homeron's death go in vain!

00:05:45.466 --> 00:05:46.466
Homeron...

00:06:12.866 --> 00:06:15.196
I see... I understand the situation.

00:06:15.366 --> 00:06:17.526
I'm very sorry, General Logi.

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:19.230
No apology needed.

00:06:19.633 --> 00:06:23.533
On the contrary, I'm grateful that you were
able to buy me as much time as you have.

00:06:25.533 --> 00:06:28.673
But, the fact that they have
the information now means...

00:06:28.933 --> 00:06:33.533
It's only a matter of time before they
try to infiltrate this place. But that is fine.

00:06:33.966 --> 00:06:34.626
Huh?

00:06:34.933 --> 00:06:40.003
Now that we know they are coming,
we can come up with countermeasures.

00:06:40.566 --> 00:06:43.526
I'm not just wasting my time,
you know.

00:06:44.033 --> 00:06:46.973
Does that mean you've already
deciphered the Extra Seven?

00:06:47.666 --> 00:06:51.366
No... But progress is
definitely being made.

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:05.270
W-What is this?!

00:07:05.733 --> 00:07:08.333
It's my personal
Shadow research facility.

00:07:08.466 --> 00:07:12.726
And the study on the Extra Seven
is done here as well.

00:07:13.633 --> 00:07:17.273
I'll show the results to you later,
Delphinium.

00:07:17.900 --> 00:07:22.030
General Logi,
what is it that you seek?!

00:07:22.866 --> 00:07:28.266
I want to see it for myself...
What Shadow really is and its possibilities...

00:07:35.833 --> 00:07:39.503
Good grief. Can you really get
stronger with a thing like this?

00:07:39.833 --> 00:07:42.673
You never had a thing for machines,
huh, Captain?

00:07:43.366 --> 00:07:45.496
I don't care if it's a new weapon or not!

00:07:45.666 --> 00:07:48.466
No one would bother to train hard
if you can get stronger this easy!

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:54.230
Yeah, but all those scientists have been
working really hard to make these.

00:07:54.433 --> 00:07:58.273
They said that it's only a prototype,
but it's probably worth trying it out.

00:07:59.300 --> 00:08:01.600
If we hadn't been on a losing streak,
there'd be no need for stuff like this!

00:08:01.966 --> 00:08:03.596
Enemy sighted! Enemy sighted!

00:08:04.366 --> 00:08:05.496
All hands, prepare for battle!

00:08:11.766 --> 00:08:14.496
Enemy count is six.
It seems to be those Shadow Wielders.

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:21.100
They've come...

00:08:21.733 --> 00:08:22.733
Comrades!

00:08:23.033 --> 00:08:25.703
We are now about to go into battle!

00:08:26.233 --> 00:08:29.703
The enemy rarely brings
the fight to us.

00:08:30.366 --> 00:08:33.666
We can assume that they
are strongly determined.

00:08:34.366 --> 00:08:36.226
Whatever you do,
do not underestimate them!

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:39.030
The enemy's target is this ship.

00:08:39.566 --> 00:08:42.966
Accordingly, we have drawn
two lines of defense!

00:08:43.866 --> 00:08:47.396
Gilliam, Todd and Bishop,

00:08:47.433 --> 00:08:49.203
you will form our vanguard,
with Cynthia joining you.

00:08:50.066 --> 00:08:53.496
Schneider, Andropov and Lemaire,
you'll be the second line of defense.

00:08:53.933 --> 00:08:55.503
Schneider and Andropov!

00:08:55.766 --> 00:08:58.196
You'll provide back-up to the vanguard
once the battle starts.

00:08:58.533 --> 00:08:59.203
Yes, sir!

00:08:59.533 --> 00:09:02.873
It is possible that the enemy
will fan out and try to infiltrate.

00:09:03.700 --> 00:09:05.470
Keep your line of defense
until your last breath,

00:09:05.500 --> 00:09:07.830
and don't let any of them
go back alive!

00:09:07.966 --> 00:09:08.966
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

00:09:09.733 --> 00:09:12.973
This is an all-out war!
I'm counting on your efforts!

00:09:24.766 --> 00:09:26.566
Well then, let's begin!

00:09:33.400 --> 00:09:36.030
There's no doubt about it...
Logi's ship is in this direction.

00:09:38.366 --> 00:09:39.366
What's this?!

00:09:39.466 --> 00:09:41.926
Something is approaching
with incredible speed!

00:09:43.533 --> 00:09:44.533
They're here!

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:04.400
Damn it! Bring it on!

00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:08.970
Marumaro, you stay here with me!
The rest of you, go!

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:11.230
I'll show them, maro!

00:10:11.733 --> 00:10:15.403
We'll take care of this point.
The rest of you should advance!

00:10:16.133 --> 00:10:18.533
Our objective is recovery
of the Extra Seven.

00:10:18.933 --> 00:10:20.033
Don't forget that!

00:10:20.466 --> 00:10:21.466
Roger!

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:22.170
Right!

00:10:22.266 --> 00:10:23.266
Let's get going!

00:10:28.466 --> 00:10:29.766
You think I'd let you do that?!

00:10:34.733 --> 00:10:36.203
Ray Stinger!

00:10:40.333 --> 00:10:41.903
So Killer Bat stayed behind!

00:10:42.433 --> 00:10:46.073
Todd! Go after them!
Bishop and I will get Killer Bat!

00:10:46.400 --> 00:10:47.400
Roger!

00:10:50.100 --> 00:10:51.270
Here they come.
Be careful!

00:10:51.433 --> 00:10:52.103
Maro!

00:10:57.566 --> 00:10:58.896
There!

00:11:02.166 --> 00:11:02.826
Damn it!

00:11:03.466 --> 00:11:04.996
Maro!

00:11:20.900 --> 00:11:22.970
Where are they?!
Huh?!

00:11:26.433 --> 00:11:30.233
Found them!
I'll give them one hell of a shot!

00:11:40.533 --> 00:11:41.203
Did that do it?!

00:11:48.400 --> 00:11:54.070
They should be done for in that explosion.
That was easier than I thought.

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:04.370
Is he gone?

00:12:04.800 --> 00:12:06.570
Yes, I think we've fooled him.

00:12:08.366 --> 00:12:10.996
Thank you, Bouquet, and Hippopotamus.

00:12:13.633 --> 00:12:16.003
No problem!

00:12:17.233 --> 00:12:19.373
That's right. Just leave it to us!

00:12:20.233 --> 00:12:21.803
Is everyone all right?

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:23.330
Okay, let's hurry!

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:34.570
It has begun...

00:12:34.933 --> 00:12:35.603
Yes...

00:12:36.300 --> 00:12:38.430
Is the combat data collection
going as planned?

00:12:38.800 --> 00:12:42.600
Yes, each section is
compiling information as planned.

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:43.370
Good!

00:12:43.633 --> 00:12:46.273
This battle will be worth watching, Captain.

00:12:46.533 --> 00:12:51.703
Yes, I would agree.
It's the Power Booster's first field test.

00:12:51.966 --> 00:12:54.966
It was created by
compiling the combat data

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:58.400
from those kids and
your independent research data.

00:12:58.733 --> 00:13:00.933
Yes, there's that too.

00:13:01.066 --> 00:13:03.466
Oh? Is there something else as well?

00:13:05.166 --> 00:13:06.926
The outcome of the battle.

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:08.300
Of the battle?

00:13:08.800 --> 00:13:11.770
Sure, those kids have learned to use
their powers more compared to before

00:13:11.800 --> 00:13:14.030
and are beginning to rival Gilliam
and the others in strength.

00:13:14.366 --> 00:13:19.626
However, our new weapon should put us
in a great advantage over them.

00:13:20.133 --> 00:13:23.803
Yet why did General Logi say?
What is he?

00:13:24.033 --> 00:13:25.073
Delphinium!

00:13:25.366 --> 00:13:26.026
Yes, sir!

00:13:26.366 --> 00:13:32.266
Watch carefully.
This battle will decide our future as well.

00:13:35.300 --> 00:13:36.800
Hornet Pierce!

00:13:42.266 --> 00:13:43.296
Are you okay?

00:13:44.566 --> 00:13:45.766
They're tough for sure!

00:13:45.866 --> 00:13:46.866
Captain!

00:13:50.966 --> 00:13:52.396
Todd! You're back!

00:13:53.333 --> 00:13:54.333
Well, in that case!

00:13:54.700 --> 00:13:58.600
Alright! Activate your medallion!
We'll settle this at once!

00:13:58.833 --> 00:13:59.833
- Roger!
- Roger!

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:01.670
What happened?

00:14:01.933 --> 00:14:03.473
Something seems odd, maro!

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:33.500
What is this light?

00:14:33.866 --> 00:14:34.866
Maro?!

00:14:37.933 --> 00:14:39.033
That light...

00:14:39.733 --> 00:14:43.273
Yes. That is the result of my research...

00:14:44.133 --> 00:14:47.903
By researching and analyzing
the battle data on Zola and her team...

00:14:47.933 --> 00:14:53.833
and with the knowledge from
translated portions of the Extra Seven,

00:14:53.866 --> 00:14:55.926
we have developed
the Power Booster!

00:15:01.666 --> 00:15:03.966
W-What is this?

00:15:04.533 --> 00:15:07.273
Amazing! I can feel my power surging!

00:15:07.533 --> 00:15:09.833
Yeah! With this, I can...

00:15:10.400 --> 00:15:13.730
Here we go.
Let's pay them back all at once!

00:15:13.900 --> 00:15:14.900
- Roger!
- Roger!

00:15:17.166 --> 00:15:17.826
Here they come!

00:15:17.866 --> 00:15:18.526
Maro!

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:23.830
- Wind Scream!
- Wind Scream!

00:15:26.500 --> 00:15:27.170
Run!

00:15:30.266 --> 00:15:31.896
Maro!

00:15:36.766 --> 00:15:37.426
What was that?!

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:38.700
It's over by...

00:15:38.733 --> 00:15:39.733
Zola and Marumaro...

00:15:42.566 --> 00:15:44.726
Is this any time to be
worried about others?

00:15:48.666 --> 00:15:50.796
Good day, boys.

00:15:51.766 --> 00:15:53.026
You again?!

00:15:53.500 --> 00:15:55.900
Jiro, I'll leave this place to you.

00:15:55.933 --> 00:15:57.733
Don't kid around. Why me?!

00:15:57.766 --> 00:15:59.566
What do you mean?
What's wrong with that?!

00:15:59.800 --> 00:16:02.570
Hey, this is no time
to be fooling around!

00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:05.470
It's us against just one opponent.
Let's break through all together!

00:16:05.833 --> 00:16:09.173
Break through?
There's no way I will let you do that!

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:13.700
What, do you think you can
stop all of us by yourself?

00:16:15.233 --> 00:16:17.503
Of course I do...

00:16:25.066 --> 00:16:25.726
What is it?!

00:16:26.066 --> 00:16:26.726
This is...

00:16:27.133 --> 00:16:31.333
The Power Booster system.
We call it the medallion.

00:16:32.033 --> 00:16:33.973
Power Booster?

00:16:34.366 --> 00:16:39.396
It just means I have become
incomparably stronger than before.

00:16:45.966 --> 00:16:47.996
Well then, let's play.

00:17:01.400 --> 00:17:04.270
What's this, maro?!
They've suddenly become stronger, maro!

00:17:04.300 --> 00:17:05.470
It's the enemy's new weapon.

00:17:06.100 --> 00:17:08.900
We should assume they're
completely different from before!

00:17:09.333 --> 00:17:10.433
This is troublesome.

00:17:10.600 --> 00:17:12.900
In an aerial battle,
the enemy will be at an advantage.

00:17:13.966 --> 00:17:14.626
Oh, shoot!

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:26.930
A-Are you all right, maro?

00:17:30.666 --> 00:17:32.726
We'll launch an attack
concentrating on one enemy!

00:17:33.300 --> 00:17:35.070
We must reduce their numbers!

00:17:37.933 --> 00:17:39.933
If you can do it, go ahead and try!

00:17:45.700 --> 00:17:48.070
We need to work together!
Focus, okay!

00:17:48.333 --> 00:17:49.403
I know that!

00:17:52.333 --> 00:17:54.403
No matter how much
stronger they've become,

00:17:54.433 --> 00:17:56.773
we'll win for sure if
we combine our efforts!

00:17:57.333 --> 00:17:58.573
Here we go!

00:18:08.766 --> 00:18:09.426
Shu!

00:18:09.566 --> 00:18:10.226
Huh?

00:18:10.533 --> 00:18:13.103
If we're gonna have some trouble,
go on ahead with Bouquet.

00:18:14.200 --> 00:18:16.070
There's no need for such concern!

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:21.230
I will settle this with one blow!
Let's go, Blue Dragon.

00:18:21.866 --> 00:18:24.226
It's about time!

00:18:24.266 --> 00:18:25.766
Shu, you're being careless!

00:18:26.100 --> 00:18:28.170
I won't forgive any of you.

00:18:29.133 --> 00:18:32.333
As long as you're around,
there'll be no end to the sadness!

00:18:32.733 --> 00:18:33.403
Kluke!

00:18:33.900 --> 00:18:35.700
Yes! I'll be the back-up!

00:18:45.733 --> 00:18:47.303
I'll cover you, Cynthia.

00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:49.200
There's no need for that.

00:18:49.400 --> 00:18:50.070
What?!

00:18:51.133 --> 00:18:55.073
I can feel it...
The power surging in my body!

00:18:55.300 --> 00:18:56.400
Now!

00:18:56.600 --> 00:18:58.630
See? Like this!

00:19:04.566 --> 00:19:05.696
Shu!

00:19:06.700 --> 00:19:09.000
This is incredible.

00:19:10.366 --> 00:19:14.366
Ah, but if you really want to help out,
I have one request.

00:19:15.466 --> 00:19:16.126
What is it?!

00:19:16.333 --> 00:19:19.473
Please block their escape route.

00:19:19.900 --> 00:19:20.900
Roger!

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:43.270
W-What's this?!

00:19:44.366 --> 00:19:45.566
Marvelous, isn't it?

00:19:45.900 --> 00:19:50.370
This is your final resting place,
the Ice Coliseum!

00:19:55.333 --> 00:19:56.673
Our escape route has been blocked...

00:19:56.933 --> 00:19:57.973
Those bastards!

00:19:58.000 --> 00:19:59.000
Calm down!

00:19:59.033 --> 00:20:02.033
I know! We should take advantage
of the fact that there's more of us.

00:20:02.333 --> 00:20:05.133
That's right. It's four against one.
We have a chance of winning.

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:07.430
We'll go around and surround them!

00:20:07.700 --> 00:20:08.870
In that case, I'll...

00:20:09.800 --> 00:20:14.000
Hipopon, Hipotama,
transform into Shu!

00:20:14.033 --> 00:20:15.033
Shu!

00:20:17.333 --> 00:20:18.333
How about this?

00:20:20.800 --> 00:20:23.270
I see!
That'll confuse them.

00:20:23.600 --> 00:20:25.330
All right, here we go!

00:20:25.533 --> 00:20:26.203
- Right!
- Right!

00:20:32.033 --> 00:20:33.903
Looks like you're done
deciding on a plan.

00:20:34.300 --> 00:20:38.370
Sorry, but we're in a hurry.
We don't have time to play with you!

00:20:38.833 --> 00:20:39.503
Here we go!

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:40.470
Right!

00:20:40.766 --> 00:20:45.966
That won't do! You're all destined
to keep me company until you die.

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:55.100
What's that?!

00:20:55.233 --> 00:20:57.603
Don't bother! We attack in unison!

00:20:59.700 --> 00:21:01.200
Eternal Breath!

00:21:01.433 --> 00:21:02.933
Fire Crisis!

00:21:04.633 --> 00:21:06.333
Fire Crisis!

00:21:14.833 --> 00:21:17.403
All right, Minotaur!
It's time for the big finish!

00:21:17.900 --> 00:21:18.570
Waves ofâ€”

00:21:20.100 --> 00:21:20.770
What?!

00:21:22.866 --> 00:21:24.066
This is!

00:21:30.133 --> 00:21:31.473
Not good enough.

00:21:31.900 --> 00:21:33.070
W-What?!

00:21:34.133 --> 00:21:37.233
I said, you're not good enough!
You bunch of little brats!

00:21:46.833 --> 00:21:48.533
Ouch...

00:21:48.666 --> 00:21:50.526
Oww...

00:21:52.266 --> 00:21:53.696
Where were you looking?!

00:21:54.400 --> 00:21:55.870
Damn...

00:22:06.200 --> 00:22:10.730
What is the deal with her power?
It's not normal!

00:22:15.133 --> 00:22:19.633
I'll take good care of everyone,
especially you.

00:24:20.000 --> 00:24:21.200
With continued use of the medallions,

00:24:21.233 --> 00:24:23.833
Cynthia and the others experience
abnormal changes in their bodies.

00:24:23.966 --> 00:24:26.296
Huh? Those guys are
turning into giants.

00:24:26.366 --> 00:24:28.066
Jiro, this is our chance, maro.

00:24:28.100 --> 00:24:30.200
What are you talking about?
Explain, Marumaro.

00:24:30.333 --> 00:24:32.233
We'll be able to see
their underwear, maro.

00:24:32.266 --> 00:24:35.366
Don't beat them until I get
a good look at the underwear, maro!

00:24:35.666 --> 00:24:38.266
Next on Blue Dragon:
Cynthia's Madness
